Now I can see the structure clearly. The `FeishuAccountConfigSchema` DOES include `allowFrom` at line 142 (AllowFromSchema). And `FeishuConfigSchema` extends `FeishuAccountConfigSchema`.

But looking at the openclaw.json structure:
```json
